GEES, PUSAN, KOREA ; EVACUATION, HUNGNAM AREA, KOREA, BOKU-DO", "rico:identifier": "111-adc-8634", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1951-01-02T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › FedFlix"}, "owl:sameAs": "NARA 111-ADC-8634", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견(검색어 비공개)", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:01:45Z", "prov:used": ["ia"]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/QF4OCzIor4S5rHJoO2i4eNOiB5MkE2", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "\"THAT WAR IN KOREA \" KOREAN WAR DOCUMENTARY 1950 INVASION TO HUNGNAM EVACUATION PART 1 6344", "rico:identifier": "QF4OCzIor4S5rHJoO2i4eNOiB5MkE2", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › PeriscopeFilm"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Encyclopedia Britannica (:41) presents \"That War in Korea\", a documentary about the Korean War of 1950 to 1953. Originally produced as a Project XX documentary. The film opens with USS Pickaway (:55). Pickaway shuttled US troops from Japan to Pusan. US soldiers bid wives and families goodbye at the start of the war (1:02). Wounded are drug across land (1:47). A funeral service follows (1:57). Rich", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견(검색어 비공개)", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:01:45Z", "prov:used": ["ia"]}}, {"@id": "https://www.koreanwar.or.kr:8443/searchDetail.do?archRfcd=1990-US-01-PF-A-00046", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "흥남철수작전 당시 대기 중인 유엔군 군함들 사진 2", "rico:identifier": "1990-US-01-PF-A-00046", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "1950-12-10", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:koreanwar:협약 › 기증 > 미국 > 해군 > 군사감실"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "제목: 흥남철수작전 당시 대기 중인 유엔군 군함들 사진 2 · 아카이브 참조코드: 1990-US-01-PF-A-00046 · 생산처/생산자: 미 해군(U.S. Navy) (KOREA ARCHIVE 심층 판독 koreanwar_item)", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견(검색어 비공개)", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:01:45Z", "prov:used": ["kore